---LINES
var     = ipv   -       -       -       -         "3.141593"
alt1    = ipa   -       -       -       -         "YES"
alt2    = ipa   -       -       -       -         "[x]"
mse     = ipm   -       -       -       -         " Quit "
VAR     = gv - - - - " VAR "
ALT     = ga - - - - " ALT "
MSE     = gm - - - - " MSE "

common  = gm - - - - " common: "
page_n  = gm - - - - " page navigation: "
specia  = gm - - - - " special: "

---SCREEN                                                          
=LINLIB generic keyboard command/actions
                                                                              
+.MSE.   .mse..... -select menu item:              .common...............                                   
+                       .:NL... or .:SP...                   get help: .:HE...
+                                                        refresh page: .:RE...
+.ALT.   .alt2.    -alter or toggle:                  exit/close page: .:EX...
+                    forward:      .:SP...                     cancel: .:CA...
+                    backward:     .:DE...                  next line: .:TA...
+                                                   
+.VAR.   .var..... -switch to edit:                .page_n...............                              
+                    keep content: .:SP...           jump to 1st line: .:KH...
+                    clear field:  .:DE...                - last line: .:KE...
+                                                      next page/part: .:PU...
+."in edit mode"................. ."with prefix".      prev page/part: .:PD...
+erase left from cursor:  .:DE...              
+    erase below cursor:  .:KD...  .:PR .:DE...	   .specia...............
+       erase up to end:           .:PR .:SP...       commit,complete,
+jump to 1st symbol:      .:KH...  .:PR .:AL...             next line: .:NL...     
+  jump to end of text:   .:KE...  .:PR .:AR...     
+toggle Ins/Ovr mode:     .:KI...  .:PR .:PR...         option prefix: .:PR...     
+                               
=LINLIB (c) 1986-1990,2020 vsv&team
---END                          
+."common"..........            .MSE.   .mse..... -------select menu item:
+."page navigation".            .VAR.   .var..... --------switch to edit: 
+."special".........                erase below cursor:  .:KD...  .:PR .:DE...
